            Add("Sail to Tonga for island feasts, reef fishing and royal celebrations.", "Sail to Tonga for island feasts, reef fishing and royal celebrations.", "Island daawaton, reef fishing aur shahi jashn ke liye Tonga ki taraf sail karo.", "Navega a Tonga para disfrutar de festines isleños, pesca en el arrecife y celebraciones reales.", "Navegue até Tonga para banquetes na ilha, pesca nos recifes e celebrações reais.", "Berlayar ke Tonga untuk pesta pulau, memancing di terumbu, dan perayaan kerajaan.", "Mets le cap sur les Tonga pour des festins insulaires, de la pêche sur le récif et des fêtes royales.", "Segle nach Tonga zu Inselfesten, Rifffischerei und königlichen Feiern.", "Ada ziyafetleri, resif balıkçılığı ve kraliyet kutlamaları için Tonga'ya yelken aç.");
            Add("Royal feasts: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai and watermelon juice.", "Royal feasts: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai and watermelon juice.", "Shahi daawatein: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai aur tarbooz ka juice.", "Festines reales: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai y jugo de sandía.", "Banquetes reais: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai e suco de melancia.", "Pesta kerajaan: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai, dan jus semangka.", "Festins royaux : lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai et jus de pastèque.", "Königliche Festmahle: Lu Pulu, Ota Ika, Faikakai und Wassermelonensaft.", "Kraliyet ziyafetleri: lu pulu, ota ika, faikakai ve karpuz suyu.");
            // Peninsula
            Add("Start your polar adventure where icebergs drift past penguin-filled bays.", "Start your polar adventure where icebergs drift past penguin-filled bays.", "Apna polar adventure wahan shuru karo jahan icebergs penguins se bhari khaadiyon ke paas tairte hain.", "Empieza tu aventura polar donde los icebergs flotan junto a bahías llenas de pingüinos.", "Comece sua aventura polar onde icebergs passam por baías cheias de pinguins.", "Mulai petualangan kutubmu di tempat gunung es hanyut melewati teluk penuh penguin.", "Commence ton aventure polaire là où les icebergs dérivent devant des baies pleines de manchots.", "Beginne dein Polarabenteuer, wo Eisberge an Buchten voller Pinguine vorbeitreiben.", "Kutup maceranı buzdağlarının penguenlerle dolu koyların önünden süzüldüğü yerde başlat.");
            Add("Penguin bays and icy channels: hot soups, fresh fish and warm cocoa for chilly explorers.", "Penguin bays and icy channels: hot soups, fresh fish and warm cocoa for chilly explorers.", "Penguin khaadiyan aur barfeeli nahrein: thande explorers ke liye garam soup, taazi machhli aur garam cocoa.", "Bahías de pingüinos y canales helados: sopas calientes, pescado fresco y cacao caliente para exploradores con frío.", "Baías de pinguins e canais gelados: sopas quentes, peixe fresco e chocolate quente para exploradores com frio.", "Teluk penguin dan kanal es: sup panas, ikan segar, dan cokelat hangat untuk penjelajah yang kedinginan.", "Baies à manchots et chenaux glacés : soupes chaudes, poisson frais et cacao chaud pour explorateurs frigorifiés.", "Pinguinbuchten und eisige Kanäle: heiße Suppen, frischer Fisch und warmer Kakao für frierende Entdecker.", "Penguen koyları ve buzlu kanallar: üşüyen kâşifler için sıcak çorbalar, taze balık ve sıcak kakao.");
            // Weddell Sea
            Add("Sail through the sea ice to cook for scientists and emperor penguin watchers.", "Sail through the sea ice to cook for scientists and emperor penguin watchers.", "Samundari barf ke beech se sail karke scientists aur emperor penguin dekhne walon ke liye khana banao.", "Navega entre el hielo marino para cocinar para científicos y observadores de pingüinos emperador.", "Navegue pelo gelo marinho para cozinhar para cientistas e observadores de pinguins-imperadores.", "Berlayar menembus es laut untuk memasak bagi ilmuwan dan pengamat penguin kaisar.", "Navigue dans la banquise pour cuisiner pour les scientifiques et les observateurs de manchots empereurs.", "Segle durch das Meereis und koche für Forscher und Kaiserpinguin-Beobachter.", "Bilim insanları ve imparator penguen gözlemcileri için yemek yapmak üzere deniz buzunun arasından yelken aç.");
            Add("Sea-ice camps by emperor penguin colonies: fish stew, herb dumplings and berry muffins.", "Sea-ice camps by emperor penguin colonies: fish stew, herb dumplings and berry muffins.", "Emperor penguin colonies ke paas sea-ice camps: fish stew, herb dumplings aur berry muffins.", "Campamentos en el hielo marino junto a colonias de pingüinos emperador: guiso de pescado, bolitas de hierbas y magdalenas de frutos rojos.", "Acampamentos no gelo marinho junto a colônias de pinguins-imperadores: ensopado de peixe, bolinhos de ervas e muffins de frutas vermelhas.", "Kemah es laut di dekat koloni penguin kaisar: semur ikan, pangsit herba, dan muffin beri.", "Camps sur la banquise près des colonies de manchots empereurs : ragoût de poisson, boulettes aux herbes et muffins aux baies.", "Meereis-Camps bei Kaiserpinguin-Kolonien: Fischeintopf, Kräuterklößchen und Beerenmuffins.", "İmparator penguen kolonilerinin yanındaki deniz buzu kampları: balık güveci, otlu hamur köftesi ve meyveli muffinler.");
            // Ross Shelf
            Add("Serve warm meals on the edge of the biggest ice shelf in the world.", "Serve warm meals on the edge of the biggest ice shelf in the world.", "Duniya ke sabse bade ice shelf ke kinare garam khana serve karo.", "Sirve comidas calientes al borde de la plataforma de hielo más grande del mundo.", "Sirva refeições quentes à beira da maior plataforma de gelo do mundo.", "Sajikan makanan hangat di tepi lapisan es terbesar di dunia.", "Sers des repas chauds au bord de la plus grande barrière de glace du monde.", "Serviere warme Mahlzeiten am Rand des größten Schelfeises der Welt.", "Dünyanın en büyük buz sahanlığının kenarında sıcak yemekler servis et.");
            Add("Glacier kitchens on the great ice shelf: grilled sausages, stews and sweet pies.", "Glacier kitchens on the great ice shelf: grilled sausages, stews and sweet pies.", "Bade ice shelf par glacier kitchens: grilled sausages, stews aur meethi pies.", "Cocinas de glaciar en la gran plataforma de hielo: salchichas a la parrilla, guisos y tartas dulces.", "Cozinhas de geleira na grande plataforma de gelo: linguiças grelhadas, ensopados e tortas doces.", "Dapur gletser di lapisan es raksasa: sosis panggang, semur, dan pai manis.", "Cuisines de glacier sur la grande barrière de glace : saucisses grillées, ragoûts et tartes sucrées.", "Gletscherküchen auf dem großen Schelfeis: gegrillte Würstchen, Eintöpfe und süße Kuchen.", "Büyük buz sahanlığındaki buzul mutfakları: ızgara sosis, güveçler ve tatlı turtalar.");
            // McMurdo
            Add("Run the busiest kitchen in Antarctica beneath a smoking volcano.", "Run the busiest kitchen in Antarctica beneath a smoking volcano.", "Dhuan chhodte jwalamukhi ke neeche Antarctica ki sabse busy kitchen chalao.", "Dirige la cocina más concurrida de la Antártida a los pies de un volcán humeante.", "Comande a cozinha mais movimentada da Antártida aos pés de um vulcão fumegante.", "Kelola dapur tersibuk di Antarktika di bawah gunung berapi yang berasap.", "Dirige la cuisine la plus animée de l'Antarctique au pied d'un volcan fumant.", "Führe die geschäftigste Küche der Antarktis unter einem rauchenden Vulkan.", "Tüten bir yanardağın eteğinde Antarktika'nın en yoğun mutfağını yönet.");
            Add("The busiest station kitchen beneath Mount Erebus: pizza night, burgers and hot drinks.", "The busiest station kitchen beneath Mount Erebus: pizza night, burgers and hot drinks.", "Mount Erebus ke neeche sabse busy station kitchen: pizza night, burgers aur garam drinks.", "La cocina de estación más concurrida al pie del monte Erebus: noche de pizza, hamburguesas y bebidas calientes.", "A cozinha de estação mais movimentada aos pés do Monte Erebus: noite da pizza, hambúrgueres e bebidas quentes.", "Dapur stasiun tersibuk di bawah Gunung Erebus: malam piza, burger, dan minuman panas.", "La cuisine de base la plus animée au pied du mont Erebus : soirée pizza, burgers et boissons chaudes.", "Die geschäftigste Stationsküche am Fuß des Mount Erebus: Pizzaabend, Burger und heiße Getränke.", "Erebus Dağı'nın eteğindeki en yoğun istasyon mutfağı: pizza gecesi, burgerler ve sıcak içecekler.");
            // South Pole
            Add("Reach the bottom of the world and cook the final feast of your world tour.", "Reach the bottom of the world and cook the final feast of your world tour.", "Duniya ke sabse neeche wale hisse tak pahuncho aur apne world tour ki aakhri daawat banao.", "Llega al fin del mundo y cocina el último festín de tu vuelta al mundo.", "Chegue ao fim do mundo e prepare o banquete final da sua volta ao mundo.", "Capai ujung bawah dunia dan masak pesta terakhir tur dunia kamu.", "Atteins le bout du monde et cuisine le festin final de ton tour du monde.", "Erreiche das untere Ende der Welt und koche das letzte Festmahl deiner Weltreise.", "Dünyanın en altına ulaş ve dünya turunun son ziyafetini pişir.");
            Add("The final feast at the South Pole: roast dinner, hot chocolate and an ice-cream celebration.", "The final feast at the South Pole: roast dinner, hot chocolate and an ice-cream celebration.", "South Pole par aakhri daawat: roast dinner, hot chocolate aur ice-cream ka jashn.", "El último festín en el Polo Sur: asado, chocolate caliente y una celebración con helado.", "O banquete final no Polo Sul: assado, chocolate quente e uma festa com sorvete.", "Pesta terakhir di Kutub Selatan: makan malam panggang, cokelat panas, dan perayaan es krim.", "Le festin final au pôle Sud : rôti, chocolat chaud et une fête à la crème glacée.", "Das letzte Festmahl am Südpol: Braten, heiße Schokolade und eine Eiscreme-Feier.", "Güney Kutbu'ndaki son ziyafet: fırın yemeği, sıcak çikolata ve dondurmalı bir kutlama.");

